Testing tail. Runs after every test-authoring ticket (DM-268–DM-272) and the end-to-end ticket DM-193 are accepted, and before Fireguard.

In the integration worktree, run the project's Definition of Done except Fireguard: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run coverage`, `npm run deadcode`, `npm run build`. This is the epic's first full sweep. Fix every failure inside the epic's scope:
- where coverage falls below the thresholds in `vitest.config.ts`, add behavioral tests to the same bar as the test tickets;
- never lower a threshold or add a lint-disable comment;
- run `npm run deadcode:refresh` only for findings confirmed intentional, and say why.

Confirm that no `scratch/` directory remains. Never run Fireguard: it is the next and final ticket, so tests added here are graded with the rest. The acceptance node reruns the Definition of Done on the final head.
